2026-06-06 19:48:33,736 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] ### Q8: Is there evidence of anti-forensics?
2026-06-06 19:48:33,737 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] **No anti-forensics on the disc itself** — CD-ROM is inherently immutable. However, the timing is significant: the disc was burned on March 26, 2015, immediately after anti-forensics cleanup (Eraser, CCleaner) on the source PC on March 24-25. This may represent data preservation after cleanup.
